OL,3,GNEWSACyclist 'rode furiously' at prams
OL,4,Aas police chased him
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cyclist rode "furiously" at babies in
OL,7,Fprams while trying to flee from police,
OL,8,Fa court has heard.
OL,10,FDaniel Kennedy, 43, swerved dangerously
OL,11,Finto traffic, almost causing a crash,
OL,12,Fafter being spotted by police cycling
OL,13,Fon the pavement while using his phone.
OL,15,FIn a bid to get away, Kennedy mounted
OL,16,Fthe pavement and rode at a family with
OL,17,Fbabies in prams, forcing them to get
OL,18,Fout of his way, Wirral magistrates were
OL,19,Ftold.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
