OL,3,GNEWSACyclist 'rode furiously' at prams
OL,4,Aas police chased him
OL,5,
OL,6,FKennedy was caught by police after
OL,7,Ffalling off his bike, and after
OL,8,Fpleading guilty to dangerous cycling,
OL,9,Fhas been convicted and given a #120
OL,10,Ffine.
